Error [E0204]: `x` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/borrow_conflict.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     both(&x, x)
    |              ^
 Why: while something is being changed through the write-capability marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: pass the write-capability marker `&` (`&x`) only once, or copy first with `~x`
